 `applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
 array using the standard `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It returns
 a new JSON value without mutating the document or patch, and throws when an operation or patch is invalid.
+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+to a JSON document. Object patches recursively merge object members and use `null` to remove a member;
+all other patches replace the target. It returns a new JSON value without mutating either input.
