+title: "Implement JSON Merge Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch as `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` exported by `src/index.ts`.
+
+The implementation must return a merged JSON document without mutating either input, recursively merge
+object patches, remove object members whose patch value is `null`, and replace the target for all other
+patch values. Document the public API and cover the RFC behaviour with deterministic automated tests.
diff --git a/src/index.ts b/src/index.ts
index 1ed1a74decb2dbc67f83d3ed4b3a11e6f90ce040..e9bb0c4f13f153e66160f8e7923bf26ebae1c7c8 100644
--- a/src/index.ts
